CEVLocalTickVolatilityTest
├── when L is zero
│   └── it should revert ZeroLiquidity
├── when L is nonzero and sqrt_p is zero
│   └── it should revert ZeroSqrtPrice
├── when L and sqrt_p are nonzero and sigma overflows u88
│   └── it should revert SigmaOverflowU88
└── when L and sqrt_p are nonzero and sigma fits u88
    └── it should return tick Tick(sqrt_p) and sigma
